  "description": "Compare Proxmox-reported guest CPU/memory with node exporter (inside the VM) and cAdvisor container totals. Pick the Proxmox guest, then select the matching node exporter host and cAdvisor endpoint if the VM runs Docker.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
