  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 18,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "markdown", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "**How to use:** select the Proxmox guest, then the node exporter host running inside that VM. If it is a Docker host, also pick the cAdvisor scrape target.\n\n| Proxmox guest | Node exporter | cAdvisor |\n|---|---|---|\n| [lab-pgdb](?var-guest=lab-pgdb&var-node=database-vm&var-cadvisor=192.168.0.145:8050) | database-vm | 192.168.0.145:8050 |\n| [prod-apps](?var-guest=prod-apps&var-node=prod-docker-server&var-cadvisor=192.168.1.16:8050) | prod-docker-server | 192.168.1.16:8050 |\n| [monitoring-stack](?var-guest=monitoring-stack&var-node=zinohub&var-cadvisor=cadvisor:8080) | zinohub | cadvisor:8080 |\n| [qbit-linux](?var-guest=qbit-linux&var-node=qbit&var-cadvisor=none) | qbit | — |\n| [wireguard](?var-guest=wireguard&var-node=wg&var-cadvisor=none) | wg | — |\n| [ark](?var-guest=ark&var-node=ark-server&var-cadvisor=192.168.1.245:8050) | ark-server | 192.168.1.245:8050 |\n| [mc-server](?var-guest=mc-server&var-node=minecraft&var-cadvisor=none) | minecraft | — |\n| [internal-nginx](?var-guest=internal-nginx&var-node=nginx&var-cadvisor=none) | nginx | — |\n| [Opnsense](?var-guest=Opnsense&var-node=opnsense&var-cadvisor=none) | opnsense | — |\n\nProxmox guest CPU is % of allocated vCPUs. Node exporter CPU is % of all VM cores. cAdvisor CPU is container CPU summed and normalized to VM core count.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Mapping guide",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
